    "poster_id": 729,
    "post_rendered": "Given is a function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/0/6705e24bcf215ec9145e46079c9662cb066efca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\mathbb{R}\\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" > such that <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/4/fc43cc720fd69cfdbb1455dfba27944675e63f5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|f(x+y)-f(x)-f(y)|\\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"224\" height=\"18\" >.</span><br>\nProve the existence of an additive function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d3372def80d2de49776d6aef150d7f32987b81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g:\\mathbb{R}\\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" > (that is <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/4/e54506e0f0eea147a9a6aa347502197f9e73a650.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x+y)=g(x)+g(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"177\" height=\"18\" >)</span> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/9/6d90b697838255aa7022f895bdfa72768854bd57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|f(x)-g(x)|\\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" > for any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/e/c0e43dc938faed17bbd60baac049bf2dd414cb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\in \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"13\" >",
    "post_canonical": "Given is a function $f:\\mathbb{R}\\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$ such that $|f(x+y)-f(x)-f(y)|\\leq 1$.\r\nProve the existence of an additive function $g:\\mathbb{R}\\rightarrow \\mathbb{R}$ (that is $g(x+y)=g(x)+g(y)$) such that $|f(x)-g(x)|\\leq 1$ for any $x \\in \\mathbb{R}$",
